            "review_title": "Review at Siglo's House",
            "review_text": "Vu_DH007\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGood steak but the service just medium or below\nSep 2015 • Friends\nbooked a table for 4 for a getting together dinner. everything was fine. the steak was good and we all had the last slice. we were offered complimentary bread.\nBUT, the service did match up with the food there.\nwhen ordering, some items in the steak menu and wine menu were not available. we were told until we asked for ordering the items. the waiter tried to get us order the most expensive beef. the same thing happened when we ordered a bottle of wine.\nthe most annoying part was the waiter opened the bottle of wine without showing it to us first. he took out from the house, opened and put it in the ice bucket and we were of aware of this action until we were served the wine by a waitress.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 22, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
