            "review_text": "Cong N\n18 contributions\n0\nTasteless\nMar 2015 • Couples\nNice interior, stylish.\nService is professional and friendly.\nTried some mixed juice and they were very nice, a tad too sweet.\nThe food was really bland. The steak that came was smaller in size than advertised. Medium well was made to Dryly well done. The mashed potato was probably not real potato but some kind of mixed powder and the sauces were really bland as well: red wine sauce tasted like beer sauce.\nThe soups were ok, but also on the bland side of the scale.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2015",
